(
    """
    RigExec example 20 - one matrix mover carrying a dense sphere.

    The simplest geometry-domain rig at density: a single control slides
    3 units along X and yaws 90 degrees and back, and one
    RigExecMatrixMover at full envelope carries all 6050 points of a UV
    sphere by the control's rigid delta. The mover reads the control
    directly (no joint in between) and binds no weight object, so every
    point follows at full strength. The sphere sits off the control's
    pivot, so the yaw orbits it instead of spinning it invisibly in
    place.

    Generated by python/make_matrix_sphere.py.
    """
